      <div>
        <div class="thm"><b>reject-synthetic-de-morgan &amp; literate-detector-null</b> — Denying synthetic synesthesia forces asserting either \(\neg\mathsf{CrossModal}\) or \(\neg\mathsf{Learned}\) (congenital literacy). Any population-deviation detector vanishes identically when prevalence reaches 100%.</div>
        <p>Type any phrase on the left to render it in the exact grapheme-color palette of <code>docs/synesthesia.cub</code>. Shared etymological roots light up as invariant chromatic signatures—turning far-apart conceptual cognates into \(O(1)\) visual neighbors.</p>
        <p><b>Cubical face-filling (`neuro/synesthesia.cub`):</b> Reading transports semantic/somatic continuations along <code>ua e</code> (<code>fill-visual-to-auditory</code>); tickertape synesthesia (Hauw &amp; Cohen 2023) is the exact inverse path <code>sym (ua e)</code>. In <code>neuro/inhibition.cub</code>, De Martino's framing-effect invariance is proved equivalent to content-descent (<code>framing-invariant-factors</code>), and addiction/engagement-maxxing is formalized as sink-attractor collapse (<code>collapse-to-sink</code>).</p>
